====Usage notes====
'''Tupi''' was first used to refer to the language in early 20th century, making it an {{glink|exonym}}. The Portuguese called it {{m|pt|língua brasílica||Brazilian language}} and {{m|pt|língua geral||General language}} in the 16th and 17th centuries, but there are no records of what name native speakers gave to it.

